  PaidWaiting --> Resident : checked in at the desk (FR-ASG-04)
  Resident --> Ended : checked out (FR-ASG-06), terminated (FR-ASG-09) or moved to another Bed (FR-ASG-10)
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Ended --> [*]

  AssignedUnpaid : Assigned – unpaid (ACTIVE)
  PaidWaiting : Paid – waiting for the door code (ACTIVE)
